    "title": "Columbus Police Hunt for Missing 14-Year-Old With Teal Hair Highlights - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rhett Parker ,\n1 days ago A 14-year-old Columbus girl with brown hair highlighted in teal green has been missing since overnight, and police have triggered an alert spanning seven central Ohio counties to help track her down. Christinna Rash was last seen leaving her home near Whitethorn Avenue and West Mound Street on the city's West Side, and investigators are urging anyone who spots her to call for help rather than approach her directly. Read full article\n5",
